-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §30 מבנה שבוע העבודה של מנהל ביישום חלקי
-- של הרפורמה: in the years of part application a school principal's
-- position base is 37, 38 and 39 weekly hours; 3 to 6 of them frontal
-- teaching hours, by the Ministry's guidelines, and management and the
-- evaluation of teachers in the rest; and the 60-minute hour of presence.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`
IMPORT `oz-founding-4`
IMPORT `oz-founding-22`

§ `30 מבנה שבוע העבודה של מנהל ביישום חלקי של הרפורמה`

§§ `30(א)`

-- Whom (א) speaks of: a school principal (§4(ה)) "ביישום חלקי של
-- הרפורמה" — of a school that applies the reform in part, which puts him
-- under it in part (§7(ג)) — in the years of part application.
@ref akn:art_30__para_a
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A `Oz staff member`
      `how far his school applies the reform` IS A `extent of the Oz reform` @desc by the Ministry's list for the year (§5(א))
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a principal in the Oz part application in` y m `how far his school applies the reform` IF
        `a year of the Oz part application` y
    AND `a principal under the Oz agreement` m
    AND `how far his school applies the reform` EQUALS `the Oz reform in part`

-- (א): the position base of a school principal in part application (a
-- position of 100%) is 37 weekly hours in תשע"ב, 38 in תשע"ג and 39 in
-- תשע"ד.
--
-- §22, whose opening speaks of the principal "ברפורמה" — in full or in
-- part, as §23 reads the same words — sets a base of 40 ((א)) and has a
-- principal whose free day is a long one complete "מכסת 40 השעות" in (ג)'s
-- windows. §30 restates (א), (ד) and (ח) for the years of part application
-- and says nothing of (ב), (ג), (ה)–(ז) (F-oz-founding-30-a). The reading
-- adopted (convention precedence.specific): §22 applies to the principal
-- in part application, and where §30 restates it §30 governs; (ג)'s window
-- completes §30's base, not 40.
@ref akn:art_30__para_a akn:art_30__para_a/p2 akn:art_30__para_a/p3 akn:art_30__para_a/p4
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the Oz principal's position base in part application in` y IS
    `by the year of part application` y 37 38 39

-- (ג) on the reading adopted: with a long day free, (ב)'s days hold 37
-- hours, and the window completes the year's base from them.
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, free IS A `the Oz principal's free day`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the hours a principal in part application completes in` y free IS
    CONSIDER `the Oz principal's position base in part application in` y
    WHEN JUST base THEN
        JUST (IF free EQUALS `a long day is the principal's free day`
              THEN max 0 (base MINUS `the hours an Oz principal's days hold by (ב)` free)
              ELSE 0)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

§§ `30(ב)`

-- (ב): in each of the years תשע"ב–תשע"ד, 3 to 6 weekly hours are frontal
-- teaching hours (in fact, in a class), by the Ministry's guidelines; the
-- range is §22(ד)'s, and 6 is in it. In the rest the principal manages the
-- school and evaluates teachers: the year's base, less the frontal hours
-- and the management hours §22(ו) spares a mother.
@ref akn:art_30__para_b
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, frontal IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `frontal hours a principal in part application may teach in` y frontal IF
        `a year of the Oz part application` y
    AND `frontal hours an Oz principal may teach` frontal

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, frontal IS A NUMBER, `management hours section 22(ו) takes off` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the hours of management and evaluation in part application in` y frontal `management hours section 22(ו) takes off` IS
    CONSIDER `the Oz principal's position base in part application in` y
    WHEN JUST base THEN JUST (base MINUS frontal MINUS `management hours section 22(ו) takes off`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

§§ `30(ג)`

-- (ג): for the principal's weekly presence in the school, an hour is 60
-- minutes; the length of a teaching period stays as the Ministry set it.
@ref akn:art_30__para_c
`minutes in an hour of a principal's presence in part application` MEANS 60

§§ `30 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `a principal in the Oz part application in` `the school year 5773` (`a serving principal of` `a four-year school, grades 9 to 12`) `the Oz reform in part`
#ASSERT NOT `a principal in the Oz part application in` `the school year 5773` (`a serving principal of` `a four-year school, grades 9 to 12`) `the Oz reform in full`
-- with a long day free: nothing to complete in תשע"ב, 1 hour in תשע"ג, 2
-- in תשע"ד; with the short day free, nothing
#ASSERT `the hours a principal in part application completes in` `the school year 5772` `a long day is the principal's free day` EQUALS JUST 0
#ASSERT `the hours a principal in part application completes in` `the school year 5773` `a long day is the principal's free day` EQUALS JUST 1
#ASSERT `the hours a principal in part application completes in` `the school year 5774` `a long day is the principal's free day` EQUALS JUST 2
#ASSERT `the hours a principal in part application completes in` `the school year 5774` `the short day is the principal's free day` EQUALS JUST 0
-- 6 frontal hours leave 31 hours of management in תשע"ב; a mother of a
-- 10-year-old, 28.6
#ASSERT `the hours of management and evaluation in part application in` `the school year 5772` 6 0 EQUALS JUST 31
#ASSERT `the hours of management and evaluation in part application in` `the school year 5772` 6 (`the management hours section 22(ו) takes off` `the Oz reform in part` 10) EQUALS JUST 28.6
#ASSERT `frontal hours a principal in part application may teach in` `the school year 5774` 6
#ASSERT NOT `frontal hours a principal in part application may teach in` `the school year 5775` 6

-- F-oz-founding-30-a's evidence: §22 has a principal whose free day is a
-- long one complete 3 hours to its 40, and §30 sets 37 for תשע"ב, which
-- (ב)'s days already hold; with the short day free they hold 40.
`section 22(ג) completes to 40 where section 30 sets a smaller base` MEANS
        `the Oz principal's position base` EQUALS 40
    AND `the hours an Oz principal completes` `a long day is the principal's free day` EQUALS 3
    AND `the Oz principal's position base in part application in` `the school year 5772` EQUALS JUST 37
    AND `the hours an Oz principal's days hold by (ב)` `a long day is the principal's free day` EQUALS 37
    AND `the hours an Oz principal's days hold by (ב)` `the short day is the principal's free day` EQUALS 40
#ASSERT `section 22(ג) completes to 40 where section 30 sets a smaller base`
#ASSERT `minutes in an hour of a principal's presence in part application` EQUALS `minutes in an hour of an Oz principal's presence`
